        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 0519, Satin Stainless Steel Commercial Corridor Pocket Pivot</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Full Mortise Pocket Pivot Hinge is typically used in corridors that have doorways such as in hospitals, high rise buildings, and hotels. It allows the door to swing open 90° so that it can lay flush with the wall to keep the doorway clear. Each pivot can bear 90 lbs. Doors 5 feet to 7-1/2 feet tall need three pivots with an additional pivot needed for every 2-1/2 feet. Built to last, this Commercial Pocket Door Pivot made by ABH features heavy duty stainless steel needle bearings and are UL listed for use on 3-hour fired rated doors. It has a Satin Stainless Steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0519.gif?v=1704354576\" width=\"584\" height=\"264\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH 0519 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA minimum of <b>three pocket pivots need to be used on doors 60\" - 90\" tall</b>. Simply add one pivot per each additional 30\" in door height. Each pivot has a 90 pound weight limit.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCross Reference--The ABH 0519 Pocket Pivot can be used in place of the following: Rixson F519, Ives 91105F, Dorma 75520, ANSI/BHMA C07611. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Pocket Pivot Hinge made by ABH:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pivot point located inside the frame.</li>\r\n<li>UL listed for use on 3-hour fire rated doors.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty stainless steel needle bearings.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel base material.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the ABH-0519 Commercial Pocket Door Pivot:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Swing: 90°</li>\r\n<li>Maximum door load per pivot is 90 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Pivoting Leaf Height: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pivoting Leaf Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fixed Leaf Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fixed Leaf Width: 1-17/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Thickness: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortised Pivot Housing Width: 1-23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortised Pivot Housing  Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortised Pivot Housing  Depth: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0519-specifcations.pdf?v=1691093121\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0519 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0519-1-34.pdf?v=1691093121\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0519 Installation Template for 1-3/4\" Doors (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0519-2-14.pdf?v=1691093121\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0519 Installation Template for 2-1/4\" Doors (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
